From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Bastiaan van der Plaat <bastiaan.v.d.plaat@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 12 Oct 2026 07:54:52 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] Add DS sound

The sounds load when they first play instead of all with the map, within
a budget of main RAM, 768 KiB on a DS, the least recently played ones
that don't play are freed for new ones, also when the main RAM runs
short, and all of them when the next map loads. They are 8-bit and play
on the hardware channels, nothing is mixed.
---
